    "# EPU Locations vs CryoSPARC Micrograph Attributes\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook maps EPU micrograph acquisition locations onto an atlas-level coordinate system and colors each location using an attribute read directly from a CryoSPARC Live session.\n",
    "\n",
    "CryoSPARC exposure information is read from:\n",
    "\n",
    "`<CRYOSPARC_PROJECT_DIR>/<CRYOSPARC_SESSION_NAME>/exposures.bson`\n",
    "\n",
    "No Curate Exposures CSV or `csv_path` is required.\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook creates one pandas DataFrame row per CryoSPARC micrograph and retains:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Paths and exposure numbers\n",
    "- Acquisition times\n",
    "- CTF fit and defocus values\n",
    "- Motion values\n",
    "- Ice thickness\n",
    "- Astigmatism and phase shift\n",
    "- Picking and extraction counts\n",
    "- Acceptance/rejection status\n",
    "- Additional values found in the raw CryoSPARC exposure attributes"
   ]
  },
